{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d74d63852562bd0ab40087d979066fd20581f6da4af9cc0ea915f82e6e82f11", "ja": "（もうすぐ、アイドル達全員が出演する特別公演。\nみんな気合いが入っているせいか、劇場が賑やかだな）", "zh": "（再过不久就是全体偶像出演的特别公演了。也许是因为大家都干劲十足，剧场里真热闹啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "92a4cfa0aea3c4a518d169ae7303bb7ba8db52cf059f95ff329fff49dc01c9d2", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　お疲れさまです！\n聞いてくださいよ、志保がボクのこと頼りになるって！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！辛苦了！\n您听我说，志保说我很可靠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "20a1a03722f976b6d6179a5be06becaf547fa19e233992ae936380d05128c972", "ja": "ま、真さん……もう。\n確かに、本当のことですけど……。", "zh": "真、真先生……真是的。\n确实，说的是真话没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1003_p", "source_sha256": "328b760e8b94f981889657b12fbc199a75db7d5bfa65bc3258be0190ccb40655", "ja": "おお、そうか。よかったな、真！\n志保に頼られるか、うん。すごくいい事だと思う。", "zh": "哦，是吗？那太好了，真！\n能得到志保的依赖吗？嗯，我觉得这可是件大好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "65f8676b7d9bd262e4f84d5f8fdfc6c8e3d4610be16b0aa00597b4ff449d1547", "ja": "そうでしょうか……。", "zh": "是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b73cf8ec8cd8bf5f0849fd4aa09a140858bc9915fe2a3d4e341d3e7478f6ee8", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、何やってるの？　早く荷物を……\nあれ、紗代子さんたちもいる。", "zh": "哥哥，你在做什么呢？快点把行李……\n咦，纱代子姐她们也在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "89731bcace6639a9ac42189f0695b0e0258c93b204c4fad7a70cf0269763ebfc", "ja": "お疲れさんです。\nみんなそろって、公演の相談かい？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n大家都到齐了，是在商量公演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "e53592b2df2b8ed701a4cdbde776eea531948f65f12debc8e0ef0e5d9d895933", "ja": "桃子、ひなた！　ちょうどいいところに来たね！\nねえ、ボクって頼りになるお姉さんかな！？", "zh": "桃子、日向！你们来得正好！\n呐，我算是个值得依靠的姐姐吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "be96ce77cd822b9c93f5f46e03c3578c05632341f0255c3875afc9a1e015b928", "ja": "え……いきなり何言ってるの？　真さん。\nそんなの当たり前でしょ。", "zh": "诶……真，你怎么突然说起这个了？\n那不是理所当然的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "ed443de923a58b4ec17e75c2ea9ddaa214877fa5acdc0fbcd405023b579217c4", "ja": "あたしも真さんのこと、いつも頼りにしてるよぉ。\nダンスも、たくさん教えてもらってるしねぇ。", "zh": "我也一直很依赖真先生哦。\n舞蹈方面也受了真先生很多指导呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "82b006720634e26db8b9aedc30cd9c5d41aea333bc24c3d7bab5df18d833dd8e", "ja": "くぅ～！　桃子とひなたもか！　やったー！", "zh": "呜～！桃子和日向也是吗！太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "a3c25a9d76c575185b4ee8877b15bcfe8662941e90547bbafe48858747ba28f9", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん、ひなたちゃん……\n私は、どうかなっ？", "zh": "桃、桃子，日向……\n我表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "2e4e12122b5319966588e00de48b372d40b4e0024a156f1cabae7fb9c5fe4337", "ja": "紗代子さんのことも、頼りにしてるよ。\nていうか、劇場のみんな、頼りになるって感じかな。", "zh": "我也很信赖纱代子姐姐哦。或者说，剧场里的大家都很可靠吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "be5765df7d366d23bd2d69756a7706a20d1b810bc8f7049ca826f372f8d8a30d", "ja": "あ、でもお兄ちゃんは別だよ？　もっと\nしっかりしてくれないと、みんなが困るんだからね！", "zh": "啊，不过哥哥你可不一样哦？要是不能更可靠一点，大家都会很困扰的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cd06c6b2e254bf0bf7ea86fb9f23212c7201872c8e4216940a431dc470737d8e", "ja": "うっ……手厳しいな。\nまあ、そうだな。俺も頑張るよ。", "zh": "呃……还真是不留情面啊。\n嗯，说得也是。我也会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1016_p", "source_sha256": "10ee531e36f40e1d159c78956ff5b4c0b0f4cce5655dbded41878bc502e020fc", "ja": "ところでみんな、特別公演が近いけど……\n準備はどうだ？", "zh": "对了，大家，特别公演就快到了……\n准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "9055cf1da37612238edf0ed1182473c9db1df1b3aa0eb6b4998a3f4b211aa5a4", "ja": "はい、ちゃんと進めてます！　というか、\nみんなすごく張り切ってるので、バッチリです！", "zh": "是的，一切都在顺利进行！应该说，大家都干劲十足，所以完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "31b7b3fddf360d63c7935fb044dae43504b9cea1721801b4c444fa6545325418", "ja": "今回は、1年を締めくくる公演ですからね！\n劇場の飾りつけから何から、全部ボクたちの手作りで！", "zh": "因为这次是为1年画上句号的公演嘛！从剧场的装饰开始，所有东西都是我们亲手做的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a6e1e09fa89e9bb590d395342f76fc5038be0ba557048b9c7cf29e1928c7f43", "ja": "特別公演のライブは、もっと大きな会場ですけど。\n劇場に来てくれるお客さんにも、楽しんでほしいので。", "zh": "特别公演的演唱会会在更大的会场举行，不过，\n我也希望能让来到剧场的客人们开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "736883844ab9b94c0ebb7870e3d36dae7c815e922f81fa46156278567f032307", "ja": "みんな、公演が楽しみなんだねぇ。\nなまらがんばって働いてるべさ。", "zh": "大家都很期待这次公演呢。\n都在特别卖力地干活呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "57bbf76abe99ea0cb254abb087978254995dd4071aab48ff9c86db56bb6a863b", "ja": "きっと、素敵な公演になるよぉ。", "zh": "一定会是一场精彩的公演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a5d17f733a4d6bfe2023fd52fd9927d2b8fccd6b42fd573cbb71d0f114e02915", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ俺は、他のみんなの様子も\n見てこようかな。引き続き、よろしくな！", "zh": "这样啊。那我去看看其他人的情况吧。接下来也拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
