{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_099_1028_p", "source_sha256": "72cb2a2702c81c5c1242a218e26af2595856d2fdd401260ca1622e6450dcd7c3", "ja": "（年の瀬の特別公演、みんなの気合いはバッチリだ。\nいい公演になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（年末的特别公演，大家的干劲都十足。看起来会是一场很棒的公演啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
